Mutation spot-check in a scratch `git archive HEAD | tar -x` copy, never the shared tree. Use the recipes in the Serena memories gotcha-local-runner-supervisor-tests and gotcha-local-runner-tests: score each mutant by exit code with --test-name-pattern='^K[1-4] ', wrap each run in timeout, and kill leftovers by a per-run env marker. Mutants, and the row that should kill each:
